// Curated new Daily Mysteries; appended without disturbing the original schedule.
module.exports=[["Kyoto","World Cities",["My cultural influence outlasted my political prominence.","Ancient traditions remain visible beside modern neighborhoods.","Temples and carefully designed gardens draw visitors here.","I was an imperial capital for more than a thousand years.","Fushimi Inari's thousands of vermilion gates are found here."],[]],["Marrakesh","World Cities",["My streets turn commerce into a sensory experience.","A walled old district preserves layers of local history.","Markets and courtyards are central to my character.","I am a historic city in Morocco near the Atlas Mountains.","Jemaa el-Fnaa square anchors my famous medina."],[]],["Cusco","World Cities",["A vanished empire continues to shape my streets.","I sit high above sea level in a mountainous region.","Stonework from an earlier civilization survives in my center.","I was once the capital of the Inca Empire in Peru.","Visitors often pass through me on their way to Machu Picchu."],[]],["Reykjavik","World Cities",["My location makes winter darkness and summer daylight dramatic.","Geothermal energy plays an everyday role here.","I sit on an island near the edge of the Arctic Circle.","I am the capital city of Iceland.","Hallgrímskirkja church rises above my colorful streets."],[]],["Istanbul","World Cities",["My geography helped empires control important trade routes.","Religious and architectural traditions from different eras overlap here.","My waterway connects two seas and separates two continents.","I was once known as Constantinople.","Hagia Sophia and the Bosporus are major landmarks here."],[]],["Lima","World Cities",["Desert and ocean meet around my expanding neighborhoods.","My cuisine draws on several cultural traditions.","I sit on a Pacific coast in western South America.","I am the capital of Peru.","The historic district includes Plaza Mayor and a Spanish colonial cathedral."],[]],["Nairobi","World Cities",["Wild animals live surprisingly close to my busy neighborhoods.","My development accelerated as railways crossed East Africa.","My surroundings include savanna landscapes.","I am the capital city of Kenya.","A national park with lions and giraffes borders my urban area."],[]],["Hanoi","World Cities",["Lakes interrupt my busy network of streets.","Traditional neighborhoods preserve many specialized trades.","My streets are known for distinctive food and motorbike traffic.","I am the capital of Vietnam.","Hoàn Kiếm Lake lies near my Old Quarter."],[]],["Porto","World Cities",["A river valley helped shape my commercial history.","Tiled façades and steep streets define parts of my cityscape.","My name is closely associated with a fortified wine.","I am a major Portuguese city beside the Douro River.","My riverside Ribeira quarter faces historic wine cellars."],[]],["Edinburgh","World Cities",["A rocky hill dominates my skyline.","I balance medieval streets with a planned Georgian district.","Festivals bring major international audiences here.","I am the capital of Scotland.","My famous castle overlooks the Royal Mile."],[]],["Cartagena","World Cities",["Walls were built to protect me from maritime attacks.","Colorful balconies overlook streets with a colonial past.","My harbor played an important role in Caribbean trade.","I am a historic coastal city in Colombia.","My walled old town is a UNESCO World Heritage site."],[]],["Dakar","World Cities",["Atlantic winds shape my coastal setting.","I grew as a commercial port on an African peninsula.","Music and contemporary art are important to my cultural life.","I am the capital of Senegal.","Gorée Island lies just offshore from my harbor."],[]],["Florence","World Cities",["Patronage helped transform my city into a center of creativity.","My streets preserve bridges and civic squares from centuries past.","A powerful banking family influenced my artistic flourishing.","I lie on the Arno River in Tuscany, Italy.","Brunelleschi designed the great dome of my cathedral."],[]],["Osaka","World Cities",["My commercial history is entwined with food culture.","I am a major urban center near Japan's inland sea.","An early modern castle is one of my landmarks.","I am known for takoyaki and a lively Dōtonbori district.","My city's name is often associated with a large historic castle in Kansai."],[]],["Prague","World Cities",["My buildings reflect several centuries of architectural change.","A river divides my historic neighborhoods.","A medieval bridge carries visitors toward an old castle district.","I am the capital of the Czech Republic.","The astronomical clock faces my Old Town Square."],[]],["Valparaíso","World Cities",["Steep hills helped determine how residents move through me.","Colorful houses and street art cover parts of my slopes.","My harbor became important to Pacific shipping routes.","I am a Chilean port city with historic funiculars.","My hillside districts overlook the Pacific Ocean near Santiago."],[]],["Tallinn","World Cities",["Medieval walls still define my old center.","Digital innovation is a point of national pride around me.","My coastline faces a gulf of the Baltic Sea.","I am the capital of Estonia.","My preserved Old Town has pointed towers and cobbled streets."],[]],["Muscat","World Cities",["Mountains meet the sea along my coastline.","My architecture emphasizes low-rise buildings and traditional forms.","Historic forts watch over my harbor.","I am the capital of Oman.","The Sultan Qaboos Grand Mosque is among my landmarks."],[]],["La Paz","World Cities",["My steep terrain makes transportation unusual.","Homes rise across a dramatic bowl-shaped valley.","Cable cars provide important public transit.","I am Bolivia's seat of government high in the Andes.","The snowy peak Illimani appears beyond my skyline."],[]],["Luang Prabang","World Cities",["Morning rituals are woven into my streets.","Colonial architecture stands alongside Buddhist temples.","Two rivers meet beside my historic center.","I am a UNESCO-listed town in northern Laos.","The Mekong River runs past my many monasteries."],[]],["Borobudur","Historic Landmarks",["Pilgrims follow a symbolic upward journey through my design.","Stone reliefs tell religious and moral stories.","My monument rises in tiers above a tropical landscape.","I am a large Buddhist temple complex in central Java.","Hundreds of Buddha statues sit among my bell-shaped stupas."],[]],["Angkor Thom","Historic Landmarks",["A walled city once enclosed a powerful royal center.","My gateways carry large sculpted faces.","My temples reflect the height of a Southeast Asian empire.","I lie near Siem Reap in Cambodia.","The Bayon temple with its many serene stone faces stands at my center."],[]],["Alhambra","Historic Landmarks",["Water and gardens are central to my design.","My interiors are famous for intricate geometric decoration.","I began as a palace and fortress complex.","I overlook the Spanish city of Granada.","The Nasrid Palaces and the Court of the Lions are found here."],[]],["Sagrada Família","Historic Landmarks",["Construction has continued across generations.","My design draws on forms found in nature.","Tall spires rise above a dense Mediterranean city.","I am a basilica designed by Antoni Gaudí in Barcelona.","My sculptural façades depict the Nativity and Passion."],[]],["Meteora","Historic Landmarks",["Monastic life developed in a dramatic elevated setting.","My structures sit atop towering natural rock columns.","Visitors climb or travel winding paths to reach historic religious communities.","I am a UNESCO site in central Greece.","Eastern Orthodox monasteries perch on my sandstone pillars."],[]],["Mont Saint-Michel","Historic Landmarks",["Tides dramatically change access to my surroundings.","A medieval religious settlement rises above a small island.","A causeway links me with the mainland.","I am in Normandy, France.","A prominent abbey crowns my rocky tidal island."],[]],["Mesa Verde","Historic Landmarks",["Communities made remarkable use of sheltered cliffs.","Stone rooms remain tucked into natural rock alcoves.","My ruins preserve the architecture of ancestral Pueblo peoples.","I am a national park in southwestern Colorado.","Cliff Palace is my largest famous cliff dwelling."],[]],["Sigiriya","Historic Landmarks",["Royal ambition reshaped a dramatic rocky outcrop.","Water gardens and frescoes remain among my features.","A palace and fortress occupied an elevated summit.","I am an ancient citadel in Sri Lanka.","A staircase once passed between enormous lion paws."],[]],["Pompeii","Historic Landmarks",["An ordinary day was preserved through sudden disaster.","Streets and household spaces reveal ancient daily routines.","Volcanic material buried my buildings for centuries.","I was an ancient Roman town near Naples.","Mount Vesuvius erupted and engulfed me in AD 79."],[]],["Himeji Castle","Historic Landmarks",["Defensive architecture determines my twisting approaches.","My brilliant pale exterior makes me visible from afar.","I represent a well-preserved example of Japanese feudal fortification.","I stand in Hyōgo Prefecture, Japan.","I am nicknamed the White Heron Castle."],[]],["Giant's Causeway","Natural Landmarks",["Repeated geometric forms make me look deliberately constructed.","Cooling lava created the patterns beneath visitors' feet.","My stones form interlocking dark columns.","I lie on the coast of Northern Ireland.","Thousands of basalt columns extend toward the sea here."],[]],["Salar de Uyuni","Natural Landmarks",["My surface can appear almost perfectly reflective after rain.","I spread across a vast high-altitude basin.","Mineral deposits create an unusually flat landscape.","I am a famous salt flat in Bolivia.","During the wet season, I can look like an immense mirror."],[]],["Ha Long Bay","Natural Landmarks",["Water has worn away exposed rock over enormous spans of time.","Hundreds of islands create a maze-like coastal landscape.","Steep limestone towers rise directly from the sea.","I lie in northeastern Vietnam.","Junks and tourist boats sail among my karst islands."],[]],["Pamukkale","Natural Landmarks",["Mineral-rich water has built terraces over centuries.","My bright surface resembles a frozen cascade.","Ancient visitors used nearby thermal pools.","I am a natural site in southwestern Turkey.","White travertine pools cascade below the ruins of Hierapolis."],[]],["Zhangjiajie","Natural Landmarks",["Tall rock pillars emerge through mist and forests.","Erosion shaped many isolated sandstone columns.","My dramatic scenery inspired artists and filmmakers.","I am a protected landscape in China's Hunan Province.","My quartz-sandstone pillars are associated with Avatar's floating mountains."],[]],["Jeju Island","Natural Landmarks",["My landscape reflects a volcanic origin.","Lava tubes and coastal cliffs attract explorers.","I combine mild coastal scenery with a prominent central peak.","I belong to South Korea, south of the mainland.","Hallasan volcano rises above my beaches and villages."],[]],["Socotra","Natural Landmarks",["Isolation allowed unusual species to evolve here.","My landscape looks unlike many places nearby.","Distinctive umbrella-shaped trees are an icon of my environment.","I am an island in the Arabian Sea belonging to Yemen.","Dragon's blood trees are famous features of my flora."],[]],["Tsingy de Bemaraha","Natural Landmarks",["My landscape is difficult to cross without specialized routes.","Limestone weathering produced a forest of jagged rock.","Rare animals inhabit the nearby dry forests.","I am a protected reserve in western Madagascar.","My sharp karst pinnacles are known locally as tsingy."],[]],["Lake Bled","Natural Landmarks",["A small island interrupts my still water.","Mountains and forested hills frame my shores.","A medieval castle rises above one side of my basin.","I am a glacial lake in northwestern Slovenia.","A church stands on the little island at my center."],[]],["Aye-aye","Wildlife",["I spend much of my life active after dark.","My unusual anatomy helps me locate hidden food.","I tap wood and extract larvae from narrow holes.","I am a rare lemur native to Madagascar.","My extremely long middle finger helps me forage."],[]],["Saiga antelope","Wildlife",["My home includes wide open grasslands of Eurasia.","My herds migrate across long distances.","An unusual facial adaptation helps filter dusty air.","I am a critically threatened antelope of Central Asian steppes.","My large flexible nose makes me instantly recognizable."],[]],["Kakapo","Wildlife",["My lifestyle differs from that of most birds in my family.","I am active at night and nest on the ground.","I cannot fly despite having substantial wings.","I am a rare parrot native to New Zealand.","My green feathers and owl-like face distinguish me."],[]],["Quokka","Wildlife",["I am a small marsupial of coastal islands.","I often rest under vegetation during daylight hours.","My facial expression can seem unusually cheerful.","I am native to southwestern Australia.","Photographs of my seemingly smiling face became famous online."],[]],["Leafy seadragon","Wildlife",["My appearance helps me disappear among marine vegetation.","I move using small fins rather than strong bursts of speed.","Long leaf-shaped appendages camouflage my body.","I am a marine fish related to seahorses.","My leafy outline is famous in southern Australian waters."],[]],["Shoebill","Wildlife",["I spend long periods standing motionless in wetlands.","My feeding technique depends on sudden strikes.","My enormous bill is shaped like an everyday object.","I am a large African wading bird.","My shoe-shaped beak gives me my common name."],[]],["Fennec fox","Wildlife",["I survive in an environment where daytime heat is intense.","My body has adaptations for releasing heat.","I am a small nocturnal canid that hunts desert prey.","I live in the Sahara and nearby North African deserts.","My exceptionally large ears distinguish me from other foxes."],[]],["Binturong","Wildlife",["I spend considerable time moving through forest canopies.","My strong tail helps me climb.","An unusual scent associated with my species resembles a snack.","I am a Southeast Asian mammal sometimes called a bearcat.","My scent is famously compared to buttered popcorn."],[]],["Red panda","Wildlife",["I use my tail to balance and stay warm.","I spend much of my time in cool mountain forests.","Bamboo is an important part of my diet.","I live in the Himalayas and nearby Asian mountains.","My reddish fur and ringed tail are distinctive."],[]],["Maned wolf","Wildlife",["My name is misleading about my closest relatives.","Long limbs help me move through tall grass.","I am an omnivorous wild canid found in South America.","I inhabit grasslands and savannas in Brazil and nearby countries.","My tall legs and reddish coat make me look like a fox on stilts."],[]],["Glass frog","Wildlife",["My small size helps me hide near forest streams.","I lay eggs on vegetation overhanging water.","Some members of my group have translucent undersides.","I am a tropical American amphibian.","My transparent belly can reveal internal organs."],[]],["Arctic tern","Wildlife",["I cover extraordinary distances each year.","I breed far north and travel toward waters far south.","My migration gives me long exposure to summer daylight.","I am a slender seabird with a red bill.","My annual route between Arctic and Antarctic regions is among the longest."],[]],["Flying squirrel","Wildlife",["My name exaggerates an ability I don't truly possess.","I move between trees without using ordinary wing beats.","A membrane of skin helps control my movement.","I am a small nocturnal gliding rodent.","I spread my limbs to glide from tree to tree."],[]],["Tardigrade","Science & Nature",["I am tiny but remarkably resilient.","I inhabit mosses, soil and freshwater habitats.","I can enter a suspended state during extreme dryness.","I am an eight-legged microscopic animal.","I am often nicknamed a water bear."],[]],["Plate tectonics","Science & Nature",["My effects unfold over enormous spans of time.","My movement reshapes mountains and ocean basins.","My boundaries can generate earthquakes and volcanoes.","I describe the motion of large sections of Earth's outer shell.","Continents slowly drift because of me."],[]],["CRISPR","Science & Nature",["My origins lie in a natural microbial defense system.","Researchers adapted me to target genetic information.","A guide molecule helps direct a cutting enzyme.","I am widely used for precision gene editing.","My name stands for clustered regularly interspaced short palindromic repeats."],[]],["Rosalind Franklin","Historical Figures",["My experiments helped reveal a hidden molecular structure.","I used a method based on the diffraction of radiation.","The pattern I recorded became a crucial scientific clue.","I produced important X-ray diffraction images of DNA.","Photo 51 is associated with my contribution to understanding the double helix."],[]],["Ibn Battuta","Historical Figures",["My journeys took me far beyond my birthplace.","I documented societies across Africa and Asia.","I traveled for decades during the medieval period.","I was a Moroccan scholar and traveler of the 1300s.","My travel account is commonly known as the Rihla."],[]],["Mary Anning","Historical Figures",["My discoveries changed how people understood ancient life.","I worked along a coast whose cliffs regularly exposed fossils.","I achieved scientific importance despite limited formal recognition.","I found major marine reptile fossils on England's Jurassic Coast.","I was a pioneering fossil collector from Lyme Regis."],[]],["Bruges","World Cities",["Waterways influenced my development as a trading center.","My streets preserve a notably medieval appearance.","Tourists often travel by boat through my canals.","I am a historic city in northwestern Belgium.","The Belfry overlooks my large market square."],[]],["Salzburg","World Cities",["My name is tied to valuable mineral trade.","A river flows through my old center beneath mountains.","Baroque architecture is central to my identity.","I am an Austrian city and birthplace of Mozart.","The Sound of Music was filmed around my streets and hills."],[]],["Bergen","World Cities",["Rain and steep hills are part of my character.","Colorful merchant warehouses recall my maritime trade.","I am an important gateway to dramatic coastal landscapes.","I am a Norwegian port city surrounded by seven mountains.","Bryggen's historic wooden waterfront is my best-known district."],[]],["Bologna","World Cities",["Students have shaped my culture for centuries.","Covered walkways extend through much of my city.","My culinary reputation is famous far beyond my region.","I am an Italian city and home to one of Europe's oldest universities.","Two leaning medieval towers rise in my historic center."],[]],["Fez","World Cities",["Artisans practice crafts in narrow old streets.","My historic quarters are known for complex alleyways.","Traditional leather workshops are a celebrated sight.","I am an ancient Moroccan city famous for its medina.","The Al-Qarawiyyin institution of learning is located here."],[]],["Antigua Guatemala","World Cities",["Volcanic peaks rise around my historic streets.","Earthquakes changed my role as a political center.","Colonial-era churches and ruins line cobblestone roads.","I am a UNESCO-listed town in Guatemala.","My distinctive yellow Santa Catalina Arch frames a distant volcano."],[]],["Gdańsk","World Cities",["Shipbuilding and trade have shaped my fortunes.","My waterfront buildings recall a prosperous merchant past.","A political movement tied to workers emerged in my region.","I am a Polish city on the Baltic coast.","Solidarity's origins are associated with my historic shipyard."],[]],["Córdoba Argentina","World Cities",["Education gives me an important national role.","Colonial churches stand beside modern neighborhoods.","I lie in a productive interior region far from the sea.","I am one of Argentina's largest cities.","My historic Jesuit Block is a UNESCO heritage site."],[]],["Tbilisi","World Cities",["Hot springs shaped my early settlement.","My architecture combines influences from several neighboring regions.","Balconies overlook a river valley through my center.","I am the capital of Georgia in the Caucasus.","Sulfur baths and Narikala Fortress are famous landmarks here."],[]],["Jaipur","World Cities",["A planned street grid distinguishes my old center.","My walls and palaces reflect a former royal state.","A warm hue gave me an enduring nickname.","I am a city in India's Rajasthan state.","The Hawa Mahal is known for its many small windows."],[]],["Udaipur","World Cities",["Water and palaces shape my appeal.","An old royal dynasty ruled this desert-region center.","White marble buildings overlook large artificial lakes.","I am a city in Rajasthan, India.","The Lake Palace sits within Lake Pichola."],[]],["Arequipa","World Cities",["A pale volcanic stone defines much of my historic architecture.","Mountains and volcanoes rise around my valley.","My colonial-era religious complex contains vivid courtyards.","I am a major city in southern Peru.","The Santa Catalina Monastery is a celebrated landmark."],[]],["Tromsø","World Cities",["My winters bring long periods without sunrise.","I am a starting point for trips into northern polar landscapes.","The aurora is an attraction during the darkest months.","I am a Norwegian city above the Arctic Circle.","The Arctic Cathedral stands beside a striking bridge here."],[]],["Banff","World Towns",["Rail tourism contributed to my early popularity.","Pine forests and high peaks surround my community.","Hot springs helped bring visitors into my valley.","I am a mountain resort town in Alberta, Canada.","I lie inside the national park bearing my name in the Canadian Rockies."],[]],["Queenstown New Zealand","World Towns",["I draw visitors seeking adventure and mountain scenery.","A large glacial lake stretches beside my town.","Outdoor sports bring travelers in all seasons.","I lie on New Zealand's South Island.","Lake Wakatipu and the Remarkables frame my surroundings."],[]],["Rovinj","World Towns",["Narrow lanes climb toward a hilltop church.","My old center was once a small island.","Fishing and maritime commerce influenced my architecture.","I am a coastal town on Croatia's Istrian Peninsula.","St. Euphemia's church rises over my red-roofed peninsula."],[]],["Chefchaouen","World Towns",["My old quarter is famous for a particular color.","Mountain slopes create a dramatic backdrop.","The streets attract photographers from around the world.","I am a town in northern Morocco's Rif Mountains.","Many of my medina's buildings are painted blue."],[]],["Ouro Preto","World Towns",["A precious metal gave me my original prosperity.","Stone streets climb hills between ornate churches.","My architecture recalls colonial Brazil's mining era.","I am a historic town in Minas Gerais, Brazil.","Baroque sculptor Aleijadinho worked on churches in this region."],[]],["Hallstatt","World Towns",["A natural resource supported settlement here for millennia.","My buildings cluster between steep slopes and water.","Traditional wooden houses face a narrow alpine lake.","I am a village in Austria's Salzkammergut region.","Ancient salt mines are associated with my history."],[]],["Sibiu","World Towns",["Merchant guilds helped shape my medieval core.","Several rooftops seem to stare at passersby.","Fortified squares preserve traditions from central Europe.","I am a Transylvanian city in Romania.","My houses are famous for small eye-shaped roof windows."],[]],["Bukhara","Historic Landmarks",["My history is linked to trade across central Asia.","Religious schools and brick minarets form part of my urban heritage.","My old quarter preserves architecture from many Islamic dynasties.","I am a UNESCO-listed city in Uzbekistan.","The Kalyan Minaret dominates my historic center."],[]],["Sukhothai","Historic Landmarks",["Ruins preserve an early Southeast Asian royal capital.","Lotus ponds surround brick and stone monuments.","My temples reflect the growth of a regional Buddhist tradition.","I am a historic park in Thailand.","The famous seated Buddha of Wat Mahathat is among my remains."],[]],["Carcassonne","Historic Landmarks",["Walls and towers dominate my silhouette.","Fortifications were restored after centuries of change.","My winding medieval streets attract visitors from afar.","I am a fortified town in southern France.","Two rings of ramparts surround my famous citadel."],[]],["Rani ki Vav","Historic Landmarks",["My architecture was built downward rather than upward.","Sculpted galleries descend through several levels.","Water storage and sacred art are combined here.","I am an elaborate stepwell in Gujarat, India.","My stepped structure was built on the banks of the Saraswati River."],[]],["Lalibela","Historic Landmarks",["Religious buildings were carved rather than assembled.","Pilgrimage remains central to my living heritage.","Rock-cut spaces connect through trenches and passageways.","I am a historic Ethiopian town.","My monolithic churches include the cross-shaped Bete Giyorgis."],[]],["Bagan","Historic Landmarks",["Brick monuments spread across a broad plain.","A powerful kingdom built many religious structures here.","Sunrise views show numerous temple silhouettes.","I am an ancient archaeological region in Myanmar.","Thousands of Buddhist pagodas rise above my landscape."],[]],["Aït Benhaddou","Historic Landmarks",["Earthen buildings rise on a rocky slope.","Caravan trade shaped my fortified settlement.","My architecture uses traditional southern Moroccan construction.","I am a historic ksar in Morocco.","Film productions often use my walled desert village as a setting."],[]],["Ephesus","Historic Landmarks",["Trade routes once connected my streets to the sea.","Stone façades reveal the scale of an ancient city.","A grand library and theater remain important attractions.","I am a Greek and Roman archaeological site in western Turkey.","The Library of Celsus stands among my ruins."],[]],["Leptis Magna","Historic Landmarks",["My fortunes rose with an expanding ancient empire.","Columns and large civic spaces survive near the coast.","One ruler spent wealth enlarging my public buildings.","I am a Roman archaeological site in Libya.","Septimius Severus was born here and later became emperor."],[]],["Hampi","Historic Landmarks",["Enormous boulders dot the landscape around my ruins.","Markets and temples recall a once-prosperous royal capital.","My buildings represent a powerful South Indian dynasty.","I am a UNESCO site in Karnataka, India.","The stone chariot of the Vittala Temple is a well-known feature."],[]],["Lençóis Maranhenses","Natural Landmarks",["My landscape changes with seasonal rainfall.","Bright sandy ridges create patterns extending toward the coast.","Freshwater pools collect between wind-shaped dunes.","I am a national park in northeastern Brazil.","My white dunes and turquoise lagoons create an unusual scene."],[]],["Wadi Rum","Natural Landmarks",["My scenery has served as a stand-in for another planet.","Sandstone towers rise from a red desert floor.","Ancient inscriptions testify to travelers over centuries.","I am a protected desert in southern Jordan.","Film crews often use my landscape to portray Mars."],[]],["Plitvice Lakes","Natural Landmarks",["Water reshapes the paths it follows through me.","Mineral deposits form natural barriers between pools.","Wooden paths pass over clear cascading water.","I am a national park in Croatia.","My chain of turquoise lakes is connected by numerous waterfalls."],[]],["Jiuzhaigou","Natural Landmarks",["My waters can appear blue, green or turquoise.","High mountains shelter alpine lakes and forests.","Waterfalls and mineral-rich pools create striking patterns.","I am a protected valley in Sichuan, China.","My name refers to nine Tibetan villages."],[]],["Sossusvlei","Natural Landmarks",["Extreme dryness helps preserve dramatic shapes.","Some of my dunes are among the highest on Earth.","Dead trees stand against pale clay and orange sand nearby.","I am a salt and clay pan in Namibia's Namib Desert.","Deadvlei and towering red dunes are associated with my landscape."],[]],["Chocolate Hills","Natural Landmarks",["My landforms form a remarkably regular pattern.","Seasonal vegetation changes their apparent color.","Hundreds of rounded mounds cover a tropical island.","I am a famous natural attraction in the Philippines.","My symmetrical hills rise across the island of Bohol."],[]],["Aoraki Mount Cook","Natural Landmarks",["Glaciers descend from my mountain slopes.","My summit attracts climbers in a southern alpine range.","I carry both an Indigenous and an English name.","I am the highest mountain in New Zealand.","I rise in the Southern Alps of the South Island."],[]],["Lake Natron","Natural Landmarks",["My waters contain unusually high concentrations of dissolved minerals.","The surrounding landscape is hot and arid.","My chemistry makes the water difficult for many animals.","I am a salt lake in northern Tanzania.","Lesser flamingos breed near my alkaline waters."],[]],["Mount Roraima","Natural Landmarks",["My flat top stands above surrounding lowlands.","Cliffs isolate unique plants and animals on my summit.","I am part of a chain of ancient sandstone table mountains.","I rise near the borders of Venezuela, Brazil and Guyana.","My tepui plateau inspired fictional lost-world landscapes."],[]],["Torres del Paine","Natural Landmarks",["Ice, water and mountains define my landscape.","Wildlife moves through windswept plains below snowfields.","Three stone peaks dominate well-known trekking routes.","I am a national park in Chilean Patagonia.","My granite towers rise above turquoise glacial lakes."],[]],["Fossa","Wildlife",["My long tail helps me move through forest branches.","I hunt animals that live high in trees.","I resemble a cat but belong to a different carnivore family.","I am native to Madagascar.","I am the island's largest native mammalian predator."],[]],["Numbat","Wildlife",["I spend much of my day searching for tiny insects.","My tongue is long and sticky.","I am a small striped marsupial with an unusual diet.","I inhabit woodlands in southwestern Australia.","I feed almost entirely on termites."],[]],["Pudu","Wildlife",["My small stature is an adaptation to dense vegetation.","I browse leaves and shoots near the forest floor.","I am a shy South American hoofed mammal.","I belong to the deer family and live in temperate forests.","I am among the smallest deer species in the world."],[]],["Markhor","Wildlife",["My agility helps me climb steep mountain slopes.","I live in rugged areas across parts of Central and South Asia.","Males carry spectacular twisting horns.","I am a wild goat found in Pakistan and nearby countries.","My corkscrew-shaped horns give me a distinctive silhouette."],[]],["Takin","Wildlife",["My build helps me move through cold mountain habitats.","I am a large hoofed animal with a thick coat.","My appearance combines features that resemble goats and cattle.","I inhabit the eastern Himalayas and nearby mountains.","I am the national animal of Bhutan."],[]],["Gerenuk","Wildlife",["My long neck helps me reach food above ground level.","I live in dry scrubland and woodland areas.","I often stand upright on my hind legs to browse.","I am an antelope of eastern Africa.","My nickname means giraffe-necked gazelle."],[]],["Dhole","Wildlife",["My groups cooperate while hunting.","I use whistling sounds among my vocal calls.","I am a reddish wild canine found in Asian forests.","I live in packs in parts of South and Southeast Asia.","I am sometimes called the Asiatic wild dog."],[]],["Serval","Wildlife",["I hunt small animals in tall grass.","My sensitive hearing helps me locate hidden prey.","I am a slender spotted feline with unusually long legs.","I live in African savannas and wetlands.","My large ears and short tail distinguish me from a cheetah."],[]],["Kinkajou","Wildlife",["I spend most of my life in trees after dark.","My tail helps me grip branches.","I feed heavily on fruit and nectar despite belonging to the carnivore order.","I inhabit tropical forests of Central and South America.","I am also called a honey bear."],[]],["Tuatara","Wildlife",["I belong to a reptile lineage much older than most modern lizards.","My growth and metabolism are relatively slow.","I have a light-sensitive organ beneath the skin of my head.","I am endemic to New Zealand.","I am the last living representative of the order Rhynchocephalia."],[]],["Okonomiyaki","Food & Cuisine",["My name suggests choosing ingredients according to taste.","I cook on a flat heated surface.","Cabbage is a central ingredient in my batter.","I am a savory pancake from Japan.","Osaka and Hiroshima have famous regional versions of me."],[]],["Feijoada","Food & Cuisine",["My cooking time allows flavors to deepen.","My ingredients reflect a history of cultural exchange.","Rice and citrus are common companions when I am served.","I am a stew featuring beans and cuts of pork.","I am strongly associated with Brazilian cuisine."],[]],["Borscht","Food & Cuisine",["I can be eaten warm or chilled.","My color often becomes unusually vivid.","Sour cream is sometimes added just before serving.","Beetroot is the ingredient most associated with me.","I am a traditional soup of eastern European cuisines, especially Ukraine."],[]],["Tagine","Food & Cuisine",["My name applies both to food and its vessel.","Slow cooking helps tenderize my ingredients.","Spices and preserved fruit can give me complex flavors.","I cook in a distinctive pot with a conical lid.","I am closely associated with Moroccan and North African cooking."],[]],["Mochi","Food & Cuisine",["My texture comes from a particular preparation of grain.","I can be filled with sweet or savory ingredients.","My chewy consistency makes me distinctive.","I am made from pounded glutinous rice.","I am a traditional Japanese rice cake."],[]],["Arepas","Food & Cuisine",["A simple grain dough forms my base.","I can be split and filled after cooking.","My crust may become crisp while the center remains tender.","I am a round cornmeal cake cooked on a griddle.","I am popular in Colombia and Venezuela."],[]],["Poutine","Food & Cuisine",["My ingredients combine a crispy base with a rich topping.","Cheese provides contrast as it softens in heat.","A savory sauce ties the dish together.","French fries, cheese curds and gravy make up my classic form.","I originated in the Canadian province of Quebec."],[]],["Jollof rice","Food & Cuisine",["Competition over recipes is part of my cultural story.","My orange-red color comes from a seasoned cooking base.","I often accompany grilled meat or chicken.","Rice cooks in a tomato-and-pepper sauce.","I am a celebrated West African dish, especially in Nigeria and Ghana."],[]],["Injera","Food & Cuisine",["My surface is filled with many small holes.","A fermented batter gives me a tangy flavor.","I am used as both food and an eating utensil.","I am a spongy flatbread traditionally made with teff.","I am central to Ethiopian and Eritrean meals."],[]],["Laksa","Food & Cuisine",["Spices perfume my broth or sauce.","Noodles and fresh herbs create contrasting textures.","Some varieties emphasize coconut while others favor sour flavors.","I am a spicy noodle soup of Southeast Asia.","I am especially associated with Malaysia and Singapore."],[]],["Gumbo","Food & Cuisine",["My thickness can come from several traditional ingredients.","I bring together cooking influences from different cultures.","A dark roux is common in many versions.","I am a hearty stew that may include okra and seafood.","I am closely associated with Louisiana Creole and Cajun cooking."],[]],["Pierogi","Food & Cuisine",["My filling can be savory or sweet.","My edges are sealed before cooking.","I am often served with butter or fried onions.","I am a stuffed dumpling frequently filled with potatoes or cheese.","I am strongly associated with Polish cuisine."],[]],["Aurora borealis","Science & Nature",["I appear when events far beyond Earth influence the night sky.","My shapes can shift rapidly across the darkness.","My colors result from particles exciting gases high above us.","I am often visible at high northern latitudes.","I am the northern lights."],[]],["Superconductivity","Science & Nature",["An ordinary property disappears in special conditions.","My behavior depends on quantum effects.","Some materials exhibit me when cooled sufficiently.","Electrical resistance falls to zero in my distinctive state.","Magnetic levitation demonstrations can use my properties."],[]],["Doppler effect","Science & Nature",["An observer's motion changes how a signal is received.","I can affect both visible light and sound.","Approaching sources and receding sources appear different.","I describe shifts in perceived frequency due to relative motion.","A passing siren changes pitch because of me."],[]],["Quantum entanglement","Science & Nature",["My behavior challenges ordinary intuitions about separate objects.","Two systems can share a joint description despite their separation.","Measurements show correlations that classical explanations cannot reproduce.","I am a phenomenon in quantum physics involving correlated particles.","My unusual correlations feature in tests of Bell inequalities."],[]],["Dark matter","Science & Nature",["My presence is inferred rather than directly seen.","My influence appears in the behavior of very large systems.","I do not emit or absorb light in the ordinary way.","My gravity helps explain how galaxies rotate and cluster.","I am the unseen component estimated to make up much of the universe's matter."],[]],["Gravitational waves","Science & Nature",["I travel across the universe without needing a medium.","My effects are extremely small when they reach Earth.","Violent cosmic events can create me.","I am ripples in spacetime predicted by general relativity.","LIGO first directly detected me from merging black holes in 2015."],[]],["Ocean acidification","Science & Nature",["My cause is connected to changes far above the water.","My effects are especially important to organisms building hard structures.","I alter a chemical balance throughout marine systems.","Absorbed carbon dioxide lowers the pH of seawater.","I threaten corals and shell-forming organisms."],[]],["Coral bleaching","Science & Nature",["My visible change signals biological stress.","A partnership between different organisms is disrupted.","Warm water can trigger my widespread occurrence.","Corals lose the symbiotic algae that give them much of their color.","Severe marine heatwaves can cause large-scale reef whitening."],[]],["El Niño Southern Oscillation","Science & Nature",["My shifts affect places far from their source.","Ocean and atmosphere interact in a repeating pattern.","I can change rainfall and storm patterns across continents.","I involves alternating warm and cool phases in the tropical Pacific.","My best-known phases are El Niño and La Niña."],[]],["Thermohaline circulation","Science & Nature",["My motion happens on a global scale.","Density differences help drive me.","Temperature and salt concentration shape my pathways.","I describe deep-ocean circulation driven by density differences.","I am sometimes called the ocean's global conveyor belt."],[]],["Ribosome","Science & Nature",["I am found in almost every living cell.","My function involves reading encoded instructions.","I link small building blocks into longer chains.","I am the molecular machinery that synthesizes proteins.","I translate messenger RNA into chains of amino acids."],[]],["Messenger RNA","Science & Nature",["I am temporary but carry consequential instructions.","My sequence is read inside a living cell.","I help connect stored genetic information to protein production.","I carry a genetic message from DNA to a ribosome.","Some vaccines deliver my instructions to cells."],[]],["LiDAR","Inventions & Technology",["I help machines describe surroundings without touching them.","My signals travel extremely quickly to nearby surfaces.","Distance can be inferred from the time between emission and return.","I use laser pulses to create detailed 3D maps.","Autonomous vehicles and surveyors use me to measure their environment."],[]],["Lithium-ion battery","Energy & Engineering",["My components transfer charged particles during operation.","My performance helped reshape portable electronics.","My electrodes store energy through reversible chemical reactions.","I am a rechargeable energy-storage device used in phones and electric cars.","My name refers to a light metal whose ions move between electrodes."],[]],["Hydroelectric dam","Energy & Engineering",["My usefulness depends on a natural cycle far larger than myself.","Water height creates a source of potential energy.","I release flowing water through machinery to generate electricity.","I am a large engineered structure that harnesses a river.","My turbines turn the power of moving water into electrical energy."],[]],["Geothermal energy","Energy & Engineering",["I am available even when wind and sunlight are absent.","The temperature difference beneath the ground can be exploited.","My heat may provide electricity or warm buildings.","I come from thermal energy stored inside Earth.","Hot underground water and steam are common sources of me."],[]],["Desalination","Energy & Engineering",["I can make otherwise unsuitable water useful.","My processes require separating dissolved substances from a liquid.","Coastal regions often invest in me where freshwater is scarce.","I remove salts from seawater or brackish water.","Reverse osmosis and distillation are common methods of mine."],[]],["Reverse osmosis","Energy & Engineering",["My process works against a tendency for water to balance concentrations.","I use a physical barrier to separate certain dissolved substances.","Pressure drives my key step.","Water passes through a semipermeable membrane while many salts are rejected.","I am widely used in water purification and desalination."],[]],["Artificial neural network","Computing & Networks",["My structure is inspired loosely by biological systems.","Training adjusts many internal numerical parameters.","Layered calculations allow me to recognize complex patterns.","I am a machine-learning model built from connected computational units.","Deep learning systems often contain many layers of me."],[]],["Blockchain","Computing & Networks",["A shared record can be maintained without one central editor.","Changing older entries becomes difficult when later records depend on them.","My structure links records using cryptographic information.","I am a distributed ledger composed of linked blocks.","I am a technology associated with cryptocurrencies and decentralized systems."],[]],["Public-key cryptography","Computing & Networks",["My design allows communication between parties who haven't exchanged a secret.","Mathematical problems protect information during transmission.","Two related keys have different roles in my schemes.","One key can encrypt or verify while a different private key decrypts or signs.","I underpin secure online communication and digital signatures."],[]],["Semaphore","Computing & Networks",["My purpose is to coordinate work among participants.","I can signal when a resource is in use.","My value controls how many tasks may proceed.","I am a synchronization mechanism used in concurrent programming.","Operating systems use me to manage access to shared resources."],[]],["Turing machine","Computing & Networks",["My simplicity contrasts with what I can theoretically express.","I operate according to explicit rules and a changing state.","Symbols on a tape can be read, written and moved past a head.","I am a mathematical model of computation involving a tape and a control unit.","My name honors a foundational twentieth-century computer scientist."],[]],["Vacuum tube","Computing & Networks",["My technology predates compact solid-state electronics.","Early communications devices relied on my ability to control current.","Electrons travel through a nearly airless enclosed space inside me.","I can amplify or switch electrical signals.","Early computers and radios used many of me."],[]],["Integrated circuit","Computing & Networks",["I allow many electronic functions to occupy little space.","My development made compact and affordable devices possible.","Tiny components are manufactured together on one substrate.","I combine transistors and connections within a semiconductor chip.","I am sometimes called a microchip."],[]],["Microprocessor","Computing & Networks",["My invention helped place sophisticated control into everyday devices.","My architecture follows programmed instructions at great speed.","I combine the main computing functions on a compact chip.","I am the central processing unit implemented as an integrated circuit.","My role in personal computers is often described as the CPU."],[]],["OLED","Computing & Networks",["My pixels need not rely on a separate backlight.","My construction enables exceptionally thin display panels.","Organic materials emit light when electrically stimulated.","I am a display technology used in televisions and smartphones.","My initials refer to an organic light-emitting diode."],[]],["E-ink","Computing & Networks",["My appearance resembles printed paper more than a glowing display.","I use relatively little energy when showing a static image.","Tiny charged particles change position to form visible text.","I am a reflective display technology commonly used in e-readers.","Electronic paper is another name for my technology."],[]],["Radar","Computing & Networks",["I allow objects to be detected when visibility is poor.","Signals travel away from a device and return after reflection.","Timing and frequency changes can reveal motion and distance.","I use radio waves to locate objects.","Air-traffic systems and weather forecasters rely on me."],[]],["Sonar","Computing & Networks",["I am especially useful in an environment where light travels poorly.","I detect objects using reflected signals.","My method measures the travel time of waves through a medium.","I use sound to find objects underwater.","Ships and submarines use me for depth finding and navigation."],[]],["Satellite navigation","Computing & Networks",["My accuracy depends on precise timing.","Signals arrive from objects far above the surface.","Receivers estimate position by comparing multiple transmissions.","I determine location using orbiting transmitters.","Modern mapping apps rely on systems such as GPS that use me."],[]],["Autopilot","Computing & Networks",["My role is to reduce routine manual control.","Sensors and feedback systems guide my adjustments.","I can hold a course or altitude as conditions change.","I am an automatic control system used in aircraft and ships.","Pilots use me to maintain flight parameters during long journeys."],[]],["Air traffic control","Computing & Networks",["My work depends on coordination rather than propulsion.","Communication and surveillance help manage complex routes.","I separate vehicles to reduce collision risk.","I organize aircraft movements on the ground and in controlled airspace.","Controllers clear pilots for takeoff, landing and safe flight paths."],[]],["Vulcanized rubber","Materials Science",["My useful properties depend on changing a natural material chemically.","My process makes elasticity more stable across temperatures.","Cross-links form between long polymer chains.","Sulfur treatment improves my strength and durability.","My development is strongly associated with Charles Goodyear."],[]],["Carbon fiber","Materials Science",["I can be both strong and unusually light.","Thousands of tiny filaments can form a single tow.","My material is often embedded in a resin matrix.","I am made from thin strands primarily composed of carbon.","Aircraft, racing bikes and sports equipment use my composites."],[]],["Graphene","Materials Science",["One thin layer can still have impressive strength.","My geometry repeats a familiar hexagonal pattern.","Electrons move through me in unusual ways.","I am a single layer of carbon atoms arranged in a honeycomb.","I can be isolated from graphite using adhesive tape."],[]],["Aerogel","Materials Science",["My volume is mostly empty space.","My lightness contrasts with a solid's appearance.","A gel's liquid component is replaced with gas.","I am an extremely low-density porous material.","My silica form is sometimes nicknamed frozen smoke."],[]],["Silicon wafer","Materials Science",["My flat surface supports microscopic manufacturing.","My uniformity is essential for precision processes.","Many circuits can be formed across me before cutting.","I am a thin disc of semiconductor material.","Computer chips are often fabricated on my surface."],[]],["Semiconductor","Materials Science",["My behavior lies between that of two familiar electrical extremes.","Small changes can greatly alter how charge travels through me.","Doping modifies my electrical properties.","I am a material whose conductivity can be controlled.","Silicon is a common example used in electronic devices."],[]],["Perovskite solar cell","Materials Science",["Researchers study my efficiency and long-term stability.","My active layer can be processed at relatively low temperatures.","My crystal structure belongs to a particular mineral family.","I am an emerging photovoltaic technology.","I convert sunlight using light-absorbing materials with a perovskite structure."],[]],["Optical fiber","Materials Science",["My signal can travel long distances with low loss.","My core guides light along a flexible path.","Total internal reflection keeps much of that light confined.","I am a thin strand of glass or plastic used to transmit information.","Modern telecommunications networks depend heavily on me."],[]],["JPEG","Computing & Networks",["My design makes large visual files easier to store and send.","I trade some detail for a smaller amount of data.","My compression is especially common with photographic images.","I am a widely used lossy image format.","My file extension often ends in .jpg."],[]],["MP3","Computing & Networks",["My format helped make portable audio libraries practical.","My coding removes some information unlikely to be noticed.","A smaller file can still contain recognizable recorded sound.","I am a digital audio compression format.","My three-character name became associated with early music players."],[]],["HTTP","Computing & Networks",["My exchanges commonly involve requests and responses.","I organize communication between clients and servers.","I define methods for obtaining or sending resources.","I am the application protocol used by much of the World Wide Web.","My abbreviation stands for Hypertext Transfer Protocol."],[]],["DNS","Computing & Networks",["I help users avoid memorizing numerical addresses.","My information is distributed across many servers.","A lookup translates a memorable name into network information.","I map domain names to records such as IP addresses.","My acronym stands for Domain Name System."],[]],["Cloud computing","Computing & Networks",["My resources can expand without a customer owning every machine.","Remote infrastructure makes services available on demand.","I commonly use virtualization and distributed data centers.","I deliver computing resources over the internet.","Online storage and hosted servers are examples of me."],[]],["Quantum computer","Computing & Networks",["My behavior depends on unusual rules of microscopic physics.","I can represent and manipulate states differently from classical systems.","Noise and error correction remain major engineering challenges.","I use qubits rather than only ordinary binary bits.","Superposition and entanglement can play roles in my computation."],[]],["Internet of Things","Computing & Networks",["Everyday objects become part of a larger network.","Sensors collect measurements and report them remotely.","Devices can exchange information without direct human interaction.","I describe connected physical objects embedded with software and sensors.","Smart thermostats and connected appliances are examples of me."],[]],["Biometric authentication","Computing & Networks",["My goal is to verify identity without relying solely on memorized information.","My input comes from characteristics of a person.","A stored template can be compared with a new measurement.","I use fingerprints, faces or other human traits for verification.","Phones often let users unlock with me."],[]],["DNA fingerprinting","Scientific Methods",["Small biological traces can reveal surprising information.","My patterns differ across individuals except in special cases.","Laboratories compare selected regions of genetic material.","I use DNA profiles to help identify people.","Forensic investigations and paternity testing use me."],[]],["PCR","Scientific Methods",["My process repeats a short sequence of temperature changes.","I work with tiny amounts of biological material.","Specialized enzymes help copy selected genetic regions.","I amplify DNA through repeated heating and cooling cycles.","My initials stand for polymerase chain reaction."],[]],["Western blot","Scientific Methods",["My workflow separates and identifies biological molecules.","A membrane receives material transferred from a gel.","Specific binding agents reveal the target.","I detect proteins using antibodies after electrophoresis.","I am a common laboratory technique for protein analysis."],[]],["ELISA","Scientific Methods",["My results often produce a measurable color change.","A carefully chosen binding interaction determines specificity.","I can test for a particular protein or immune response.","I use enzyme-linked antibodies or antigens for detection.","My acronym stands for enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay."],[]],["Sanger sequencing","Scientific Methods",["My approach reads genetic information one position at a time.","Special molecules terminate chains during replication.","Fragments of different lengths reveal the sequence.","I am a classic method for determining DNA base order.","My name honors the biochemist who developed chain-termination sequencing."],[]],["Gene therapy","Scientific Methods",["My treatment target lies inside living cells.","Delivery is often one of my largest challenges.","My approach attempts to address a disorder at the genetic level.","I introduce, modify or replace genetic material to treat disease.","Some of my techniques use modified viruses as delivery vehicles."],[]],["Stem cells","Scientific Methods",["My descendants can take on different specialized roles.","I can replenish tissues under certain conditions.","My developmental potential varies among different types.","I am an unspecialized cell capable of self-renewal and differentiation.","Embryonic and adult forms of me are studied in regenerative medicine."],[]],["X-ray crystallography","Scientific Methods",["My results depend on patterns formed by scattered radiation.","Orderly arrangements make my method possible.","Mathematical analysis reveals arrangements on an atomic scale.","I use X-ray diffraction from crystals to infer structures.","My method was crucial to determining many proteins and DNA structures."],[]],["Electron diffraction","Scientific Methods",["My method depends on the wave behavior of particles.","A regular structure creates an interference pattern.","The resulting image helps reveal atomic arrangements.","I use electrons scattered by matter to study crystal structures.","My patterns demonstrate the wave nature of electrons."],[]],["Radiocarbon dating","Scientific Methods",["My clock relies on a natural change over time.","I compare surviving atoms with expected quantities.","My reach is especially useful for relatively recent archaeological material.","I estimate the age of once-living matter using radioactive carbon.","The isotope carbon-14 is central to me."],[]],["Dendrochronology","Scientific Methods",["My records are written by living organisms.","Changes in climate affect the patterns I study.","Matching repeating growth patterns creates a timeline.","I determine ages and past conditions from annual tree rings.","Ancient wooden structures can be dated using me."],[]],["Remote sensing","Scientific Methods",["I gather information without direct contact with the target.","Patterns in reflected or emitted energy can reveal conditions.","My equipment can travel above the ground on aircraft or satellites.","I observe Earth's surface from a distance using sensors.","Satellite images are a familiar example of me."],[]],["GIS","Scientific Methods",["I link information with places on a map.","Layers can show relationships between different kinds of data.","I help analyze patterns across geographic space.","I am a geographic information system.","Urban planners use me to combine maps, census data and land use."],[]],["Prosthetic limb","Medical Technology",["I help replace a function lost through injury or difference.","My fit and control are essential to everyday use.","Some modern versions use sensors and powered components.","I am an artificial replacement for an arm or leg.","My design can restore mobility or assist grasping."],[]],["Insulin pump","Medical Technology",["My precise doses help manage an important biological process.","I deliver medication through a small wearable system.","Some versions respond to glucose-sensor readings.","I give insulin continuously or in programmed doses.","I am used by some people living with diabetes."],[]],["Artificial heart valve","Medical Technology",["I control the direction of a flowing liquid.","My design must endure constant repeated movement.","I can be made from mechanical materials or biological tissue.","I replace a damaged valve inside the heart.","My purpose is to keep blood moving in the proper direction."],[]],["Dialysis machine","Medical Technology",["My operation substitutes for part of an organ's role.","A membrane helps separate substances from a liquid.","My process can remove excess fluid and waste products.","I filter blood when kidneys cannot function adequately.","I am central to many hemodialysis treatments."],[]],["Ventilator","Medical Technology",["I can support a process people normally do automatically.","My settings control pressure, volume and timing.","Air moves through a circuit connected to the patient.","I assist or replace breathing by delivering air into the lungs.","Hospitals use me when patients need mechanical ventilation."],[]],["Pulse oximeter","Medical Technology",["I estimate an important property without drawing blood.","Light of different wavelengths travels through tissue.","A small sensor often clips to a finger.","I estimate the oxygen saturation of blood.","My display usually shows SpO2 and pulse rate."],[]],["Robotic surgery","Medical Technology",["My instruments can translate small operator movements.","My systems can provide magnified views in confined spaces.","The human operator remains responsible for decisions.","I use computer-controlled instruments during surgical procedures.","Some hospitals use a da Vinci system for me."],[]],["Laparoscope","Medical Technology",["My narrow profile allows access through a small opening.","I carry a viewing system into the body.","My images help guide minimally invasive procedures.","I am an instrument used to look inside the abdominal cavity.","Surgeons use me in keyhole abdominal operations."],[]],["Endoscope","Medical Technology",["My design allows viewing difficult-to-reach internal spaces.","A flexible tube may carry light and a camera.","Special tools can sometimes pass through channels within me.","I help examine hollow organs without large incisions.","Gastroenterologists often use me to inspect the digestive tract."],[]],["Positron emission tomography","Medical Technology",["My images depend on signals produced inside the body.","A tracer helps reveal metabolic activity.","Detectors capture paired gamma rays from particle interactions.","I am a nuclear medical imaging technique often abbreviated PET.","I can help assess cancer, brain function and heart tissue."],[]],["ECG","Medical Technology",["My tracing records changes over time.","Several electrodes measure signals at the body's surface.","My waveform helps reveal patterns in an organ's rhythm.","I record the electrical activity of the heart.","My acronym stands for electrocardiogram."],[]],["EEG","Medical Technology",["My recordings show rapidly changing patterns.","Sensors detect tiny electrical signals through the scalp.","My results are used in sleep studies and seizure evaluation.","I record the brain's electrical activity.","My acronym stands for electroencephalogram."],[]]];
